            "review_title": "Review at Som Tum Thai - Lê Thánh Tôn",
            "review_text": "DJaaayyy\nMelbourne, Australia83 contributions\n1\nGreat local Thai restaurant whilst in Saigon\nSep 2024 • Couples\nOn one of those rainy evenings when it was too wet to travel too far, we went to the Som Tum Thai restaurant (just near our hotel) and we were pleasantly surprised at the great quality food provided and the overall good value of our dinner. If you are staying in the vicinity of the restaurant, it is definitely worth a visit for some beautiful food. Staff were also awesome and friendly, and spoke great English (for us travellers)\nRead more\nWritten September 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
